{"quest_id": 8260, "name": "混乱してる女の子", "description": "王子たちはハニーの案内でリズナを発見。\nしかし、なにやら様子がおかしくて……？\n\n上級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv10）", "event": "ランス1000　再び交わる世界", "event_category": "Reproduce", "mission_id": 320424, "map_no": 4897, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 50, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 16000, "attack": 500, "base_hp": 16000, "base_attack": 500, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 300, "magic_defense": 90, "attack_speed": 1, "attack_wait": 40, "attack_interval": 124, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.5, "transform_resist": 100, "pattern_id": 2152576, "race_id": 16, "special_effect_id": 1713, "master_id": 37408, "global_id": 11025}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 23, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["ハニー"], "hp": 1000, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 1000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "magic_defense": 90, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 111, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2113808, "master_id": 30890, "global_id": 4509}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["ハニー"], "hp": 1200, "attack": 250, "base_hp": 1200, "base_attack": 250, "damage_type": "magical", "armor_defense": 30, "magic_defense": 90, "attack_range": 140, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2113840, "missile_id": 7, "missile": {"speed": 6.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 30892, "global_id": 4511, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 64}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 78}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 6, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["エスネア＆エフネのファン"], "hp": 2000, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 2000, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 15, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 66, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2107936, "race_id": 3, "master_id": 958, "global_id": 957, "spawn_sec": 98}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "hp": 6000, "attack": 1000, "base_hp": 6000, "base_attack": 1000, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 100, "attack_speed": 120, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 241, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.7000000476837158, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2100144, "race_id": 10, "master_id": 219, "global_id": 218, "spawn_sec": 147}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 4, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["ハニー"], "hp": 2000, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 2000, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "magic_defense": 90, "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 111, "move_speed": 600.0, "gain_cost": 3, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2113856, "master_id": 30893, "global_id": 4512, "spawn_sec": 177}], "popups": ["リズナの\n攻撃を受けた味方ユニットは\n3秒間、攻撃力と\n防御力が減少します。\n\nこの効果は、状態異常に対する\nユニットの能力では\n軽減、無効化できません。"], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "ハニーＤ", "text": "ざわ……。", "face": "l0a288895e9cd"}, {"name": "ハニーＥ", "text": "どきどき……。", "face": "l0a288895e9cd"}, {"name": "ハニーＦ", "text": "はぁはぁ……。\nあくおち？　これってあくおち？", "face": "l0a288895e9cd"}, {"name": "ハニーＤ", "text": "やだー。\nリズナちゃんが悪堕ちやだー。", "face": "l0a288895e9cd"}, {"name": "グリム", "text": "――いた！　いました！\nリズナさーん！　大丈夫ですかー！？", "face": "u942"}, {"name": "リズナ？", "text": "はにほー。", "face": "u2155a1"}, {"name": "シィル", "text": "えっ。\nど、どうしたんですかリズナさん！？", "face": "u581"}, {"name": "リズナ", "text": "あいやー。", "face": "u2155a1"}, {"name": "グリム", "text": "リズナさんの発言がハニーみたいになってます！", "face": "u942"}, {"name": "シャルロット", "text": "魔神セーレに無理やり能力解析をされて、\n混乱しているのかもしれませんわ！", "face": "u128"}, {"name": "ホーネット", "text": "なるほど……？\nやけに詳しいのですね？", "face": "u2157a1"}, {"name": "シャルロット", "text": "過去に色々ありまして……。", "face": "u128"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "えぇと、ではまず、\nリズナさんを落ち着かせる必要があるということで？", "face": "lbd47455882a3"}, {"name": "ハニーＦ", "text": "えーっ、悪堕ちリズナちゃんと、\nめくるめくメガネ次元の旅したいのにー。", "face": "l0a288895e9cd"}, {"name": "ハニーＥ", "text": "めがねー、めがねっこはいねがー。", "face": "l0a288895e9cd"}, {"name": "フェリス", "text": "ハニーは……ただ悪ノリしてるだけみたいね。\n一緒に叩いちゃいましょ。", "face": "u2159a1"}, {"name": "ウルザ", "text": "王子さん、ハニーとリズナさんは、\n魔法に強い耐性があります。", "face": "u2158a1"}, {"name": "ウルザ", "text": "世界の理が異なるこの世界でも、\nおそらくその能力は健在です。\n兵への指示は慎重にお願いしますね。", "face": "u2158a1"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "リズナ", "text": "あら……ここは……？", "face": "u2155a1"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "よかった、正気に戻ったようですね。\n怪我はありませんか？"}, {"name": "リズナ", "text": "大丈夫です。\nうぅ、でも何だか、\n心の内側を覗かれたような、嫌な感じが……。", "face": "u2155a1"}, {"name": "シャルロット", "text": "魔神セーレがリズナさんの能力を解析したのは、\nどうやら事実のようですわね……。", "face": "u128"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "……急ぎましょう。\nこのまま際限なく新たな能力を獲得されると、\n対抗策がなくなる可能性があります。", "face": "lbd47455882a3"}, {"name": "グリム", "text": "セーレの魔力は……ふんふん。\nあっちの方みたいです。案内しますよー。", "face": "u942"}]}], "active": true}